# .important — key info for this repo

## GitHub token (FILL THIS IN YOURSELF)

```
GITHUB_TOKEN=
```

> Blank on purpose: no PAT exists in the build environment — git auth there is
> handled transparently by the host (askpass). To transfer to a new device:
> paste a PAT above (fine-grained or classic, scope: repo), then either:
>
>     git remote set-url origin https://<TOKEN>@github.com/ywhshhs/luadeobf.git
>
> or keep the clean URL and use:
>
>     git config --global credential.helper store   # then push once, paste token
>
> Verify with: `git ls-remote origin` (must list refs/heads/main).

## Repo

- remote : https://github.com/ywhshhs/luadeobf.git (branch: main)
- owner  : ywhshhs
- what   : luadeob — versatile, profile-driven Luau/Lua deobfuscator (Python + lupa)

## Layout

```
luadeob/            the framework (see luadeob/README.md for full docs)
  core.py           Pass/Context/Report/Pipeline
  fingerprints.py   obfuscator + technique detection (Luraph v15/v14, Clyde, ...)
  rbxenv.py         FULL Roblox executor environment (offline)
  sandbox.py        lupa sandbox, capture system, Luau->Lua5.5 compat, workers
  worker.py         killable subprocess runner (deadline = hard kill)
  profiles.py       12 builtin profiles + learn mode
  luatokens.py      safe Lua lexer + string decode + luau_check
  passes/           strings, fold, beautify, peel, xor, dispatch, rename, vm_static
make_samples.py     generator for the 10 test samples (randomized keys each run)
obf_samples/        level1.lua .. level10.lua (difficulty 1-10)
STATUS.md           current task: what I'm working on / trying to fix
docs/OBFUSCATION_METHODS.md   key notes on obfuscation methods (what we learnt)
```

## Quick commands

    python3 -m luadeob script.lua --json            # agent mode (full JSON report)
    python3 -m luadeob script.lua --profile luraph  # per-obfuscator tuning
    python3 -m luadeob loader.lua --fetch -o out/   # real fetch + recursive peel
    python3 -m luadeob script.lua --learn --learn-to profile.json
    python3 make_samples.py            # regenerate all samples w/ fresh keys
    python3 make_samples.py 6 7 8 9 10 # regenerate only levels 6-10

## Environment facts (build machine)

- Python 3.11.14, lupa 2.8 -> Lua 5.5 runtime (string.pack/unpack native)
- NO standalone luajit/lua binaries; no luau-ast binary on Linux
- lupa CANNOT iterate Lua tables inside Lua->Python callbacks (JSONEncode is pure Lua)
- install: pip install lupa

## Local secrets (NOT committed)

- /home/runner/workspace/.env — OPENCODE_* API keys (sk-...), unrelated to git push
- git auth on the build box: transparent askpass (no PAT on disk)
